1
00:00:04,950 --> 00:00:07,700
My name is Lando.

2
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:11,050
I am the savior who will save the Earth.

3
00:00:11,050 --> 00:00:11,900
What?!

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,900
Lando? It can't be!

5
00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,150
You know him?

6
00:00:15,150 --> 00:00:17,600
He was a leading authority on Getter Rays,

7
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:20,500
on a par with Father and Dr. Tachibana.

8
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:24,950
So that satellite Getter Beam Cannon was
Lando's work, too!

9
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,100
Precisely.

10
00:00:27,100 --> 00:00:31,600
A demon's hand is about to transform the Earth.

11
00:00:32,050 --> 00:00:33,300
The time has come.

12
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:35,900
Bow before me and obey!

13
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:38,850
We shall return to our primitive state!

14
00:00:38,850 --> 00:00:40,550
Lando! My brother...!

15
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,400
What have you done with Shinichi?!

16
00:00:43,050 --> 00:00:44,700
Your brother, Shinichi?

17
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,600
Lando was a brilliant scientist.

18
00:00:48,250 --> 00:00:50,450
My brother left Father's lab

19
00:00:50,450 --> 00:00:53,350
to work at Lando's research institute.

20
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,900
But Lando's ideas were so dangerous,

21
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,550
he was expelled from the scientific community.

22
00:00:58,550 --> 00:01:01,950
That's when he and my brother disappeared.

23
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,750
Dangerous ideas?

24
00:01:04,050 --> 00:01:07,650
Getter Rays are a super energy that drives
evolution.

25
00:01:07,650 --> 00:01:10,900
Lando wanted to force humanity to evolve with
Getter Rays

26
00:01:10,900 --> 00:01:13,700
and create a new form of life.

27
00:01:14,750 --> 00:01:17,400
But that is all in the past now.

28
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:20,250
For you in the Allied Army,

29
00:01:20,250 --> 00:01:22,550
I shall send a special soldier.

30
00:01:22,550 --> 00:01:25,350
You may ask that one about Shinichi, too.

31
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,600
Do enjoy yourselves.

32
00:01:31,450 --> 00:01:33,000
Lando!
